                Your profile is incomplete! <br><br>
                Please either <b>complete the full professional profile</b> (Doctor, Work Type, Clinic Type, Computer), or else <b>select a Profile Pending Reason</b> to save it as incomplete.
            </div>
            <div class="modal-footer" style="background-color: #f8fafc;">
                <button type="button" class="btn-sf-primary" data-bs-dismiss="modal" style="width: 100%;">Okay, I will fix it</button>
